---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie & Tracking Technologies Policy"
  description="Details regarding the utilization of cookies, local storage, analytics, and advertising preferences on CryptoPulse."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/cookie-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that retain preferences and enhance navigation efficiency. We categorize cookies into Essential (strictly necessary for core site rendering and security) and Analytics/Advertising (evaluating audience readership patterns).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">2. Managing Cookie Preferences</h2>
        <p>You can adjust your browser settings to reject cookies or notify you when a cookie is placed. Note that disabling cookies may affect certain customized features such as saved ticker favorites or instant search memory.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>